{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:00 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:00 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:00 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"富韻樓有外傭暈倒。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/ed8a6801b1e1d5d3336a802f585f7937/2026-10/page_152.jpg\"/><p>今日（18日）早上11時40分，深水埗富昌邨富韻樓一名外傭在單位內暈倒，消防接報趕到，破門入屋後發現女事主陷入昏迷，並依靠在一把風扇旁邊。事件一度懷疑女傭觸電暈倒，救護員隨即將她送往明愛醫院搶救。警方經調查後相信事件與觸電無關，不排除女傭患病，正調查事件起因。</p><img alt=\"案發於富韻樓單位。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/707364340f3f1b3827af104948639e2b/2026-10/1_1_24.jpeg\" title=\"案發於富韻樓單位。梁國峰攝\"/><p>案發於富韻樓單位。梁國峰攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/29967374f6aa1c0835372ffcb5ed63f2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_12_39_24.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a1b227219b58dc37a4a69178ca08cd67/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_12_39_23.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:39:31.177270+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T05:00:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T11:17:51.165910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:37:42.511439+00:00","content_hash":"0151bbff4656372c97b1203490053cd824391ff8bf9b7719baa36841d491c03f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}